      227.99
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE MARRIAGES (GENERAL)ORDINANCE NO. 19 OF 1907",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      242.57,
      401.89,
      266.99
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      281.57,
      401.88,
      305.99
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Marriages (General)(Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      320.57,
      401.88,
      357.95
    ],
    "text": "2.The Preamble of the Principle enactment is herebyamended by deletion of the words \u201cother than the marriagesof Muslims\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      372.65,
      401.88,
      422.99
    ],
    "text": "3.Notwithstanding anything contrary to the provisionsof the Principle enactment or the provisions of any other law,the Marriages (General) Ordinance No. 19 of 1907 shallprevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      437.57,
      401.89,
      461.87
    ],
    "text": "4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
